WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Insert the hook through the cloth.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Catch the thread below.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.600
Lift a loop through the cloth.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.650
Pull each new loop through the previous one.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.000
Anchor the last loop with a tiny stitch.
